WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.100
On a hill in Makkah, a man calls
each clan of his tribe by name.

2
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.160
He asks: if I told you an
army was behind this hill,

3
00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.600
would you believe me?

4
00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.940
They say yes.

5
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.000
They have only ever known him as truthful.

6
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.740
Then he gives them a
very different warning,

7
00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.340
and his own uncle curses him.

8
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:25.100
So why did the Prophet climb that
hill and call out to his whole tribe?

9
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:30.460
In this mission, you'll read 5 verses
from Surah 26 linked with that day.

10
00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:35.980
Then you'll weigh up a modern question: is
it wrong to try to convert people today?

11
00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:40.050
Your mission: find out why the
Prophet called out from that hill.
